OL,3,GNEWSABaby died eight days after
OL,4,ACaesarean birth - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby boy who died shortly after he
OL,7,Fwas born was the "most precious and
OL,8,Fperfect" child, an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FRichard George was delivered by
OL,11,FCaesarean section at Blackpool Victoria
OL,12,FHospital in December 2024 when his
OL,13,Fmother, who had maternal diabetes, was
OL,14,F36 weeks pregnant. He died eight days
OL,15,Flater.
OL,17,FIn a statement read out at Blackpool
OL,18,FCoroner's Court, his mother Jossymol
OL,19,FGeorge, 37, and father, Sajan Thomas,
OL,20,F41, said they had been "over the moon"
OL,21,Fto be completing their family before
OL,22,Fthe birth of their third child.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
