OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after Richard's birth, they said
OL,7,Fmedics did not make it clear that their
OL,8,Fbaby was seriously unwell and there was
OL,9,F"no real urgency" among staff, who
OL,10,Fseemed "very relaxed".
